    "custom_collections_community_L76mjK": {
      "type": "custom-collections-community",
      "blocks": {
        "comment_card_4ibE8K": {
          "type": "comment_card",
          "settings": {
            "comment": "“This bike is super sick! The lower seat height makes it super nice and comfy since I’m a shorter guy. It wheelies straight out of the box super well and the thicker wheels makes it feel like I have full control over the bike. The 13 amp battery gives me 20+ miles of hardcore riding and the brakes have insane stopping power. I would highly recommend buying this awesome bike!\"",
            "img": "shopify://shop_images/6_cf7eb899-5107-49cf-ae55-8921b7254890.webp",
            "name": "Jacob P.",
            "product": "macfox-x7"
          }
        },
        "comment_card_gzLdjU": {
          "type": "comment_card",
          "settings": {
            "comment": "“Great e-bike! So easy to wheelie, and also the easiest bike to mod for sure. Parts are very high quality, and do not disappoint.Also it handles jumps like crazy the only thing I have to say that is ok is the back suspension,but besides that it is great!\"",
            "img": "shopify://shop_images/macfox-x2-mountain-ebike-reviews.webp",
            "name": "Westyn M.",
            "product": "macfox-x2"
          }
        },
        "comment_card_HahxMa": {
          "type": "comment_card",
          "settings": {
            "comment": "“Well, my son loves the bike, and so do his friends. At least 4 of them in his circle, followed our path and got their own X1s's. I bought the back tail light, different throtle style, front wheel screws (good have extras as most teens tend to wheelie on them and screws can get lose) and now recently I got a tire replacement. Bike has been great. For the price you get a great deal a a nice looking bike. My son got it for Christmass and so far hes gotten close to 700 miles on it. Mostly street rides.  Also important, the fact that they have a local presence and customer service here in the US. Any issues that we have encountered have been met with good service so far and thats a great advantage.  Overall. He is really happy with his bike and so I am. I would definately recommend the X1s to anyone looking for a cool reliable bike. ”",
            "img": "shopify://shop_images/macfox-x1s-commuter-ebike-reviews.webp",
            "name": "Attn Enrique V.",
            "product": "macfox-x1"
          }
        },
        "comment_card_GMciQA": {
          "type": "comment_card",
          "settings": {
            "comment": "“I like it it's not very fast but it looks better then other bikes and it's very fun and really easy to wheelie\"",
            "img": "shopify://shop_images/macfox-x1s-x-bs-zay-commuter-ebike-reviews.webp",
            "name": "Catalina G.",
            "product": "x1s-x-bs-zay"
          }
        },
        "comment_card_9h7T6f": {
          "type": "comment_card",
          "settings": {
            "comment": "“This bike is absolutely amazing. I modded it as you can see, it’s comfy and easy for hand drags, perfect for wheelies”",
            "img": "shopify://shop_images/macfox-x7-offroad-ebike-reviews.webp",
            "name": "Dylan C.",
            "product": "macfox-x7"
          }
        },
        "comment_card_keEe34": {
          "type": "comment_card",
          "settings": {
            "comment": "“I love my macfox so much and it’s so fun to wheelie. They are super customizable and the frames don’t snap 😏. When I broke my macfox throttle they personally reached out to me and dmed me on tiktok, I now have a new throttle for free!  I love macfox!”",
            "img": "shopify://shop_images/macfox-x1s-commuter-ebike-reviews-2.webp",
            "name": "Ryder H.",
            "product": "macfox-x1"
          }
        }
      },
