        "custom_liquid": "<style>\n    .cs-liquid-box {\n        position: relative;\n        width: 100%;\n        overflow: hidden;\n    }\n    .cs-liquid-box .mobile {\n        display: none;\n    }\n    .cs-liquid-content {\n        position: absolute;\n        top: -20%;\n        left: -35%;\n        padding: 30% 10% 30% 40%;\n        width: 80%;\n        height: 140%;\n        background-color: rgb(0 0 0 / 49%);\n        border-radius: 50%;\n    }\n    .cs-liquid-content h2 {\n        margin-bottom: 2vh;\n        font-size: 2vw;\n        line-height: 1.2;\n        color: #f2cb04;\n        font-family: Antonio;\n    }\n    .cs-liquid-content p {\n        color: #d6d6d6;\n        font-size: 1.2vw;\n        line-height: 1.5;\n    }\n    @media screen and (max-width: 768px) {\n        .cs-liquid-box .mobile {\n            display: block;\n        }\n        .cs-liquid-box .pc {\n            display: none;\n        }\n        .cs-liquid-content {\n            top: -30vw;\n            left: -20vw;\n            padding: 35vw 25vw 18vw 25vw;\n            width: 140vw;\n            height: 130vw;\n        }\n        .cs-liquid-content h2 {\n            font-size: 26px;\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n        .cs-liquid-content p {\n            font-size: 12px;\n        }\n    }\n</style>\n<div class=\"cs-liquid-box\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0714/3581/3182/files/1-03_1.webp?v=1758791764\" alt=\"\" class=\"cs-image full_width pc\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0714/3581/3182/files/1-04_1.webp?v=1758791752\" alt=\"\" class=\"cs-image full_width mobile\">\n    <div class=\"cs-liquid-content\">\n        <h2>Fat Bikes for All Terrains</h2>\n        <p>The Macfox fat tire electric bike combines the rugged durability of wide tires with the ease and fun of electric assistance, making it the perfect ride for any terrain. Whether you’re coasting along sandy beaches, cutting through snowy trails, or navigating bumpy city streets, Macfox has you covered with excellent stability, traction, and power. As one of the best electric bikes for adults, it’s designed for ultimate comfort and control, featuring adjustable suspension, powerful disc brakes, and battery options to fit your needs. So, whether you’re commuting, going off-road, or just exploring new places, the Macfox fat tire e-bike will be your trusty companion, making every journey smoother and more enjoyable.\n</p>\n    </div>\n</div>",
