    "custom_liquid_bVeYtD": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "disabled": true,
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<style>\n    .cs-liquid-box2 {\n        display: flex;\n        flex-wrap: wrap;\n        gap: 1vw;\n        padding: 5vw;\n        width: 100vw;\n    }\n    .cs-liquid-box2 .box-left {\n        display: flex;\n        flex-wrap: wrap;\n        gap: 1vw;\n        width: 52vw;\n        height: 45vw;\n    }\n    .cs-liquid-box2 .box-left h2 {\n        display: flex;\n        align-items: center;\n        padding: 2vw;\n        width: 21vw;\n        height: 21vw;\n        background-color: #f2cb04;\n        font-size: 2vw;\n        line-height: 1.2;\n        font-weight: 700;\n        text-align: center;\n        font-family: Antonio;\n    }\n    .cs-liquid-box2 .box-left p {\n        display: flex;\n        align-items: center;\n        justify-content: center;\n        margin: 0;\n        padding: 2vw;\n        width: 30vw;\n        height: 21vw;\n        background-color: #1d1d1d;\n        font-size: 1vw;\n        color: #919191;\n        line-height: 1.5;\n        text-align: center;\n        overflow: hidden;\n    }\n    .cs-liquid-box2 .box-left div {\n        width: 52vw; \n        height: 23vw;\n    }\n    .cs-liquid-box2 .box-right {\n        width: 37vw;\n        height: 45vw;\n    }\n    .cs-liquid-box2 .box-bottom {\n        display: flex;\n        gap: 1vw;\n    }\n    .cs-liquid-box2 .box-bottom h2 {\n        display: flex;\n        align-items: center;\n        justify-content: center;\n        margin: 0;\n        padding: 2vw;\n        width: 40vw;\n        background-color: #1d1d1d;\n        font-size: 2vw;\n        color: #f2cb04;\n        line-height: 1.5;\n        font-weight: 700;\n        text-align: center;\n        font-family: Antonio;\n    }\n    .cs-liquid-box2 .box-bottom p {\n        margin: 0;\n        padding: 2vw;\n        width: 49vw;\n        background-color: #1d1d1d;\n        font-size: 1vw;\n        line-height: 1.5;\n        color: #919191;\n        text-align: center;\n    }\n    @media screen and (max-width: 768px) {\n        .cs-liquid-box2 {\n            padding: 15px;\n            gap: 15px;\n        }\n\n        .cs-liquid-box2 .box-left {\n            gap: 15px;\n            width: 100%;\n            height: auto;\n        }\n\n        .cs-liquid-box2 .box-left h2 {\n            padding: 30px;\n            width: 100%;\n            height: auto;\n            font-size: 26px;\n        }\n\n        .cs-liquid-box2 .box-left p {\n            padding: 30px;\n            width: 100%;\n            height: auto;\n            font-size: 12px;\n            text-align: left;\n        }\n\n        .cs-liquid-box2 .box-left div {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: auto;\n        }\n\n        .cs-liquid-box2 .box-right {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: auto;\n        }\n\n        .cs-liquid-box2 .box-bottom {\n            flex-direction: column;\n            gap: 15px;\n        }\n\n        .cs-liquid-box2 .box-bottom h2 {\n            padding: 30px;\n            width: 100%;\n            font-size: 26px;\n        }\n\n        .cs-liquid-box2 .box-bottom p {\n            padding: 30px;\n            width: 100%;\n            font-size: 12px;\n        }\n    }\n</style>\n<div class=\"cs-liquid-box2\">\n    <div class=\"box-left\">\n        <h2>Maximizing Range:Dual Batteries Assist Long-distance Riding</h2>\n        <p>Macfox long range ebikes are engineered to travel longer distances on a single charge, with high-capacity lithium-ion batteries typically ranging from 500Wh single cell to 1000Wh dual cell. These bikes are assisted by high-efficiency brushless motors and feature lightweight construction made of aluminum material. Advanced electronics optimize power delivery and monitor battery usage, providing real-time data on range and performance. Macfox electric bikes continue to improve range and performance through advances in battery technology and motor efficiency.</p>\n        <div>\n            <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0714/3581/3182/files/macfox_-05.webp?v=1725243849\" alt=\"\" class=\"cs-image cover\">\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"box-right\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0714/3581/3182/files/1-05_1.webp?v=1758791854\" alt=\"\" class=\"cs-image cover\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"box-bottom\">\n        <h2>Power Perfected: Macfox Bikes' Rear Motor System</h2>\n        <p>The Macfox electric bike features a rear motor system, positioning its powerful propulsion unit at the rear wheel for optimal performance. This design choice embodies Macfox's commitment to innovation and engineering excellence, providing riders with a balanced and reliable riding experience. Whether navigating steep inclines or cruising through urban streets, the Macfox ebike's rear motor delivers smooth acceleration and responsive power delivery. With this advanced motor configuration, Macfox ensures that riders enjoy enhanced traction, efficiency, and control, making every journey an exhilarating adventure.</p>\n    </div>\n</div>",
